{"4071450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pink Light", "steam_appid": 4071450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/2c91f99915354f92fe6e37acdbbe4403.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing a quest from the guild, the devoted Sister met a demon who had disguised herself as a priestess. The Sister was powerless against the demon’s overwhelming strength. At the end of the fight, the demon carved an abominable crest onto the Sister’s body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon promised to remove the crest if the Sister could retrieve a certain crystal from the dungeon. Without knowing how to dispel the curse, the Sister had no choice but to obey the demon’s wishes and challenge the dangerous dungeon of Yarashina City once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remove the crest? What is the reason behind the demon's request? Find out everything before the creeping and unknown danger reaches the city of Yarashina!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May God bless your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/f8adcd900ce95a0aac60ab060c206dec.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a devoted Sister who can’t use healing magic despite her holy appearance. Use your sword to explore a dungeon full of danger and monsters. Discover equipment that can strengthen your stats or transform your appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect loot, learn enemy attack patterns, and avoid sudden traps. Every second counts in this fast-paced action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon and the city to uncover the darkness hidden deep within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/c19d0418d91d77a30b3e77a6393ec468.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/113f72371cc4004e54b56c6f980743fe.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/9d806b230f8d323f66d341750d2dc568.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes in the dungeon. Relentless enemy attacks, unpredictable traps, and the crest’s negative effects on your body will demand split-second decisions to ensure your journey to the depths of the dungeon goes smoothly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sister’s Appearance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up the Sister with various outfits that can be found in the game. Several accessories will affect her stats and appearance. Make sure to collect them all and dress her up the way you like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Crest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crest from the demon will affect your daily adventures and may become a fatal disadvantage if you're not careful. Manage it by refueling its energy in town before you venture into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/2c91f99915354f92fe6e37acdbbe4403.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing a quest from the guild, the devoted Sister met a demon who had disguised herself as a priestess. The Sister was powerless against the demon’s overwhelming strength. At the end of the fight, the demon carved an abominable crest onto the Sister’s body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon promised to remove the crest if the Sister could retrieve a certain crystal from the dungeon. Without knowing how to dispel the curse, the Sister had no choice but to obey the demon’s wishes and challenge the dangerous dungeon of Yarashina City once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remove the crest? What is the reason behind the demon's request? Find out everything before the creeping and unknown danger reaches the city of Yarashina!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May God bless your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/f8adcd900ce95a0aac60ab060c206dec.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a devoted Sister who can’t use healing magic despite her holy appearance. Use your sword to explore a dungeon full of danger and monsters. Discover equipment that can strengthen your stats or transform your appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect loot, learn enemy attack patterns, and avoid sudden traps. Every second counts in this fast-paced action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon and the city to uncover the darkness hidden deep within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/c19d0418d91d77a30b3e77a6393ec468.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/113f72371cc4004e54b56c6f980743fe.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/extras/9d806b230f8d323f66d341750d2dc568.avif?t=1779750721\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes in the dungeon. Relentless enemy attacks, unpredictable traps, and the crest’s negative effects on your body will demand split-second decisions to ensure your journey to the depths of the dungeon goes smoothly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sister’s Appearance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up the Sister with various outfits that can be found in the game. Several accessories will affect her stats and appearance. Make sure to collect them all and dress her up the way you like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Crest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crest from the demon will affect your daily adventures and may become a fatal disadvantage if you're not careful. Manage it by refueling its energy in town before you venture into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In this action RPG, play as a devoted Sister cursed by a demon and stripped of healing magic. Fight through a deadly dungeon with fast-paced sword combat, various gear choices, and relentless traps. Uncover dark secrets before Yarashina City falls.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/ab2c8aa78a0a55c02e6dc5f06985b50f265f7cef/header.jpg?t=1779750721", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/4df63d7c85e6b50c20f46e38bc4497ec2be9c67b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779750721", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071450/4df63d7c85e6b50c20f46e38bc4497ec2be9c67b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779750721", "website": "https://saikeystudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7/8/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "2026 Saikey Studios", "developers": ["Umashi Village"], "publishers": ["Saikey Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description"